{{Quote|You ride with Mossy, Garvish? Saw Gerrera? Fall asleep on watch, they're gonna put your head on a pike for a laugh.|Arvel Skeen, to Karis Nemik|audio=Skeen-Pike.flac|<ref name="Aldhani">{{Andor|Aldhani (episode)}}</ref>}}
'''Garvish''' was an individual active during the [[Imperial Era|reign]] of the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Aldhani" /> In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{AndorDate|104}}</ref> the rebel [[Arvel Skeen]] caught his colleague [[Karis Nemik]] [[Sleep|asleep]] on watch while the pair were part of an [[Aldhani rebel infiltration team|infiltration team]] on the [[planet]] [[Aldhani]]. After waking Nemik, Skeen warned him that if he had been caught sleeping on guard duty while working with Garvish, [[Mossy]], or [[Saw Gerrera]]<ref name="Aldhani" />&mdash;head of the [[Partisans]]<ref name="ROUVG">''[[Star Wars: Rogue One: The Ultimate Visual Guide]]''</ref>&mdash;then any of the trio would have impaled his head on a pike for a laugh.<ref name="Aldhani" />

==Behind the scenes==
Garvish was mentioned in "[[Aldhani (episode)|Aldhani]]," the fourth episode of the [[Andor Season 1|first season]] of the [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'',<ref name="Aldhani" /> which aired on [[September 28]], [[2022]].<ref name="Release dates">{{Twitter|starwars|status/1557442379975573504|[[Star Wars]]|date=2022-08-10|quote=This is what revolution looks like. Watch #Andor, a Star Wars Original Series, streaming only on @DisneyPlus September 21.|archivedate=20220810191942}}</ref>

